# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile needs.
# Everything else (target/, dist/, .git, caches, local secrets) stays out.
*
!Dockerfile
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!site.yaml
!redirects.yaml
!content
!templates
!themes
!plugins

# Secrets never enter the context, even inside an allowed directory.
# (Later lines win, so these come last.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/master.key
**/*.key
**/*.enc
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/credentials*.json
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.cache
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
